nd=\"223\" data-start=\"187\">valid UPSSSC PET 2025 score card</strong> to be eligible for the recruitment.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 76px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 28.9421%; text-align: center; height: 76px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Scientific Assistant </strong>(Special Selection)</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 25px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 28.9421%; text-align: center; height: 25px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Accountant / Auditor</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 71.0579%; height: 25px;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Candidates must have a <strong data-end=\"81\" data-start=\"23\">Bachelor\u2019s degree in Commerce (B.Com) with Accountancy</strong> from a recognized university and <strong data-end=\"212\" data-start=\"115\">at least one year of experience in accounting in a government or semi-government organization</strong>. Additionally, applicants must possess a <strong data-end=\"290\" data-start=\"254\">valid UPSSSC PET 2025 score card</strong> to be eligible for the recruitment.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 25px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 28.9421%; text-align: center; height: 25px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Legal\u00a0Assistant</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 71.0579%; height: 25px;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Candidates must have a <strong data-end=\"57\" data-start=\"23\">Bachelor\u2019s degree in Law (LLB)</strong> from a recognized university and <strong data-end=\"176\" data-start=\"91\">at least three years of experience as an Advocate, Lawyer, Barrister, or Attorney</strong>. Additionally, applicants must possess a <strong data-end=\"254\" data-start=\"218\">valid UPSSSC PET 2025 score card</strong> to be eligible for the recruitment.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 25px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 28.9421%; text-align: center; height: 25px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><