be released?</span></strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Answer:</strong><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"> The <strong data-end=\"234\" data-start=\"200\">Exam City Intimation Slip 2026</strong> has been released online on the official UPSSSC website before the examination to help candidates know their allotted exam city.</span></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Question:</strong> <strong>How can I check the UPSSSC UP Pollution Control Board Exam City Details 2026?</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Answer:</strong> Visit the official UPSSSC website, log in using your <strong data-end=\"576\" data-start=\"553\">Registration Number</strong>, <strong data-end=\"595\" data-start=\"578\">Date of Birth</strong>, and <strong data-end=\"622\" data-start=\"601\">Verification Code</strong>, then download the <strong data-end=\"671\" data-start=\"642\">Exam City Intimation Slip</strong>.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<div class=\"flex-shrink-0 flex flex-col relative items-end\">\n<div>\n<div class=\"pt-0\">\n<div class=\"gizmo-bot-avatar flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-full\">\n<ul>\n<li class=\"relative p-1 rounded-sm flex items-center justify-center bg-token-main-surface-primary text-token-text-primary h-8 w-8\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Question:</strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"> What credentials are required to download the Exam City Slip?</span></strong></span></li>\n<li class=\"relative p-1 rounded-sm flex items-center justify-center bg-token-main-surface-primary text-token-text-primary h-8 w-8\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Answer:</strong> Candidates need their <strong data-end=\"838\" data-start=\"815\">Registration Number</strong>, <strong data-end=\"857\" data-start=\"840\">Date of Birth</strong>, and <strong data-end=\"892\" data-start=\"863\">Verification Code/Captcha</strong> to access the Exam City Slip.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Question:</strong> <strong>Is the Exam City Slip the same as the Admit Card?</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Answer: </strong>No. The Exam City Slip only provides information about the allotted examination city. The Admit Card will be released separately and will contain the exact examination centre address and other important details.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Question:</strong> What is the official website for <b>UPSSSC?</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Answer:</strong> The official website for <strong>UPSSSC</strong><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><strong>\u00a0</strong></span>is <strong>https://upsssc.gov.in/</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<p><img alt=\"UPSSSC UP Pollution Control Board Various Post Exam Date 2026\" class=\"size-full wp-image-35958\" decoding=\"async\" fetchpriority=\"high\" height=\"576\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" src=\"http://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/UPSSSC-UP-Pollution-Control-Board-Various-Post-Exam-Date-2026.jpg\" srcset=\"https://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/UPSSSC-UP-Pollution-Control-Board-Various-Post-Exam-Date-2026.jpg 1024w, https://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/UPSSSC-UP-Pollution-Control-Board-Various-Post-Exam-Date-2026-300x169.jpg 300w, https://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/UPSSSC-UP-Pollution-Control-Board-Various-Post-Exam-Date-2026-768x432.jpg 768w\" width=\"1024\"/></p>\